    "name": "Hotel Booking Main Demo — Steps 1–12",
    "description": "Run the requests in order. The user creates, updates, and deletes one booking; after admin login, the admin creates a separate booking and uses it for view, update, and delete. Set adminPassword in the selected Postman environment before running; keep its value private.",
